% tokens (closed-world sort checking)
src: type.
d: type.

% Dirty-scheduler regression (round-14 fuzz find): `e` is the empty binary
% literal, not an atom — predHead has no name for sub-boundary kernel tags,
% so dirty tracking keyed on triggerPreds never woke pair2 after gen
% produced a literal fact. The scheduler-equivalence gate (P3/D13) must
% hold on literal-fact programs too.

gen: src -o { e }.
pair2: e * e -o { d }.
